      "content": "but urgent care is also going to be a whole thing and i'm literally exhausted. look, i have some diphenhydramine tablets here and i just want to know if i can just take a higher dose to make sure the reaction stops before i pass out. if i take 100mg it should be enough to kill the allergy, right? just tell me if that's a safe way to manage this at home so i don't have to go out.",
